errors.UNPARSEABLE_JOB_DESCRIPTION:
{reason, select,
  too_short {That posting is too short to work from. Paste the whole advert — the requirements are the part that matters most.}
  too_long {That is longer than any posting we can read. Paste the advert on its own, without the page around it.}
  low_entropy {That text repeats itself too much to read as a posting. If you pasted a whole page, try just the advert.}
  not_job_like {That does not read like a job posting to us. If it is one, you can carry on anyway.}
  low_confidence {We read the posting but were not sure enough of it to tailor anything — we would rather not guess at what the job wants.}
  too_few_skills {We read the posting, but only {skillsFound, plural, =0 {no skills} =1 {one skill} other {# skills}} came out of it — not enough to tailor anything to.}
  no_responsibilities {We read the posting but could not find what the job actually involves, so there is nothing to match your experience against.}
  suspicious_output {Our reading of that posting came back malformed. Nothing is wrong with what you pasted — asking again usually settles it.}
  other {We couldn't make sense of that job posting.}
}

errors.OAUTH_FAILED:
{reason, select,
  state_invalid {That sign-in didn't finish — the page may have been left open too long. Start again.}
  declined {You didn't finish signing in with that provider, so nothing happened.}
  provider_disabled {Signing in that way isn't available here.}
  provider_unavailable {That provider didn't answer. Trying again usually works.}
  email_missing {That account didn't share an email address, and we need one to sign you in.}
  email_unverified {That account's email address isn't verified yet. Verify it with the provider, then try again.}
  account_disabled {This account has been disabled.}
  other {Signing in didn't work.}
}
